      17: { p: "Sentence Parts: Subject", a: "The subject is that part of a sentence about which something is being said." },
      18: { p: "Sentence Parts: Predicate", a: "The predicate is that part of a sentence that says something about the subject." },
      19: { p: "Sentence Parts: Clause", a: "A clause is a group of words that contains both a subject and a verb." },
      20: { p: "Independent Clause", a: "An independent clause expresses a complete thought like a sentence." },
